    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Initiate a two-step transfer of the admin (owner) role to `new_admin`.\\n\\n`live_until_ledger` is the ledger up to which `new_admin` may `accept_admin`. Pass\\n`current_ledger + N`, where `N` is the acceptance window in ledgers. The standard window\\nfor a real ownership handover is **3 days** = `current_ledger + 3 * DAY_IN_LEDGERS`\\n(51_840 ledgers); the sensible range is 24h (17_280) to 7d (120_960). There is deliberately\\nno default \\xe2\\x80\\x94 every call states its window explicitly.\\n\\nA non-zero window beyond the in-contract ceiling of 7 days (`MAX_ACCEPTANCE_WINDOW` =\\n120_960 ledgers past the current ledger) panics [`Error::AcceptanceWindowTooLong`].\\n`live_until_ledger == 0` is exempt from the ceiling and cancels a pending transfer (the\\nlibrary requires the cancel call to name the current pending address).",
      "name": "set_admin",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_admin",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "live_until_ledger",
          "type_": "u32"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  },
